# Caches: raw HTTP bodies are bulky and re-fetchable, so they stay local.
# Normalised evidence records (runs/*/evidence/*.json) and the LLM response
# cache (.cache/llm/) ARE committed — they are what makes a run replayable
# and claims spot-checkable without re-running. See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.
.cache/http/

